OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: How to Listen
OL,6,     F3/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,7,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,8,     Flistening. Today, Sakari explores
OL,9,     Fhow listening over time can
OL,10,     Finfluence our relationship with
OL,11,     Fthe music we hear.
OL,12,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,13,     FAlyn Shipton presents a
OL,14,     Fpiano-focused edition of the
OL,15,     Fprogramme, journeying from the
OL,16,     Fhard-swinging stride of the big
OL,17,     Fbands to contemporary British
OL,18,     Freleases.
