OL,5,G1900 Sunday Feature: Whitman and
OL,6,G     Vaughan Williams
OL,7,     FVaughan Williams was devoted to
OL,8,     FWalt Whitman's poetry, carrying it
OL,9,     Fwith him and setting it often.
OL,10,     FLaura Barton explores what drew
OL,11,     Fhim so strongly to the the
OL,12,     FAmerican poet.
OL,13,G1945 Words and Music
OL,14,     FFrom boating in Wind in the
OL,15,     FWillows to boredom in the
OL,16,     Fschoolroom described by DH
OL,17,     FLawrence, Haydn's symphony 'Il
OL,18,     FDistratto' (The Distracted) to
OL,19,     FJohn Coltrane's Lazy Bird.
